# The package holds only what the extension needs to run, what its listing
# shows, and the licences. Everything is left out first, and the lines
# starting with `!` bring back what ships. vsce applies a `!` line over
# every other line, whatever their order, and ignores .gitignore whenever
# this file exists, so a file that is not named below never ships —
# sources, tests, docs, images for the README, or anything a tool drops
# into the repository root.
**

# The manifest, its translations, and the Marketplace listing. README
# images are not needed: vsce points them at the repository on GitHub.
!package.json
!package.nls.json
!package.nls.ja.json
!README.md
!CHANGELOG.md
!images/icon.png

# The licence, and those of the code bundled into dist/: their notices
# must travel with that code.
!LICENSE
!THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md
!third-party/*.txt

# What runs: the two bundles (not their source maps), the engine, the
# bundled library, the grammars, the language configuration, the
# translations and the pages of the previews.
!dist/*.js
!dist/engine/**
!dist/stdlib/**
!dist/syntaxes/**
!language-configuration.json
!l10n/**
!media/**
